        "id": "2111335579447185496",
        "images": [
          "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUz4hT8XoAA68fl.jpg?name=small"
        ],
        "media": [
          {
            "height": 900,
            "type": "photo",
            "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUz4hT8XoAA68fl.jpg?name=small",
            "width": 1600
          }
        ],
        "name": "Texas Twins Dad",
        "text": "This is wild…\nI first subscribed to learn about Grok Bot, now it’s my personal agent that does so many works. My favorite use cases are booking appointments and solving taxes.\n\nI see more potential as it’s bringing more features. I honestly felt it is too slow to use when it first launched. Now.. it is wild.. it responds instantly!\n\nI’ve been using Grok Voice a lot lately and the access to Grok Bot has never been this easy from my Cybertruck. It even pulls up web browser!\n\nJust try Grok Bot if you haven’t..",
        "url": "https://x.com/Texas_Twins_Dad/status/2111335579447185496",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
      },
