          "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HU3msrCXgAAqyHk.jpg?name=small"
        ],
        "media": [
          {
            "height": 746,
            "type": "photo",
            "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HU3msrCXgAAqyHk.jpg?name=small",
            "width": 1320
          }
        ],
        "name": "Katie Miller",
        "text": "I placed an ordered a dress for a black tie event via @bot. \n\nIt was never delivered (thanks @DHLGlobal). \n\nBot submitted a refund request to the company, including contacting the DHL. \n\nBot tracked the delivery, followed up with the merchant and just now notified me that the refund appeared back on my credit card. \n\nIt’s automating the worst part the shopping experience: refunds & returns.",
